  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, a summoner can regain his MP quicker. The summoner must be relaxed and free from overt distractions, such as combat raging nearby or other loud noises, and does not gain this recovery if asleep or unconscious. The summoner regains 1 MP per hour. This increases by 1 for every five summoner levels after 5th (Clear Mind I at 5th, II at 10th, III at 15th, IV at 20th).</p>",
